'''Fann''' is an [[NPC]] who resides in {{zone|Pet Care}} with '''Hootie''', her pet owl. She trains [[Pets]] for a duration of time, leveling them up.

== Overview ==
'''Fann''' trains [[Pets]] for a duration of time, leveling them up. Up to 3 pets may be trained at a time by feeding Hootie {{Item|Great Carrot Candy|5|text=Great Carrot Candies}} and {{Item|Ultimate Carrot Candy|1}} to unlock training slots #2 and #3, respectively.

The cost of leveling up a pet is dependent on the training duration and type. An {{Item|Owl Pet}} can decrease the {{Coins|alt=Coin}} cost by up to 5% and increase the amount of Pet XP earned by up to 10%, and syphoning {{Item|Boreal Owl Shard}}s can additionally increase the amount of Pet XP earned by up to 20%.

Training can be canceled at any time for free by talking to Fann or by going upstairs in Pet Care and selecting the pet, but doing this only refunds half the remaining training time.

The usage of an {{Item|Enchanted Clock}} can skip {{Green|1 hour}} of the time taken to level up a pet. This ability has a {{Green|48 hour}} cooldown.

