== Trivia ==
*Disabling Calling Services will cause '''Fann''' to show up as Do Not Disturb enabled, even if the player's Abiphone does not have that ability.
*Despite being able to gain Pet XP through other traditional means, the Owl Pet cannot be trained by '''Fann''' because selecting it puts it in its respective slot, and trying to input another Owl Pet into the training slot gives the error message: {{Dialogue|&cYou already have an item in that slot!}}

